[TITLE]
FV storage node -- the only corpus deck reaching the semi-implicit bucket
relaxation (relaxOneNode). Plain junctions are algebraic interfaces, so
without a [STORAGE] section the corpus is blind to that path. Body mirrors
the retired node-Picard unit fixture, at solver defaults.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
FLOW_ROUTING         FV
START_DATE           01/01/2026
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/01/2026
END_TIME             02:00:00
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         5

[JUNCTIONS]
J1  100.0  8.0  0  0  0

[STORAGE]
J2  99.0  8.0  0  FUNCTIONAL  0  0  12.5

[OUTFALLS]
OF   98.0  FREE  NO

[CONDUITS]
C1  J1  J2  300  0.02  0  0  0  0
C2  J2  OF  300  0.02  0  0  0  0

[XSECTIONS]
C1  RECT_OPEN  6.0  40.0  0  0  1
C2  RECT_OPEN  6.0  40.0  0  0  1

[INFLOWS]
J1  FLOW  ""  FLOW  1.0  1.0  120.0

[TIMESERIES]

[REPORT]
INPUT  NO
CONTROLS  NO
